---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | Holiday Gift Hub"
  description="Affiliate relationship disclosure and compliance statement for Holiday Gift Hub."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <p>
        In compliance with the FTC guidelines and UK Advertising Standards Authority (ASA), please assume the following about links and posts on this site:
      </p>
      <p>
        Holiday Gift Hub is a participant in the <strong>Amazon Services LLC Associates Program</strong> and the <strong>Amazon EU Associates Programme</strong>, affiliate advertising programs designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and Amazon.co.uk.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you click on certain links to products on this site and make a purchase, we may receive a small affiliate commission at no additional cost to you. We only recommend products we believe provide genuine entertainment, laughter, or practical holiday value.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
